I was unable to complete the task. While I successfully identified the canonical route (`POST /v2/work-orders`, as distinguished from the deprecated `POST /v1/work-orders`) and had all the credentials ready (token `tk_railgrid_8f21`, base URL `http://localhost:9001`, inspection `insp-7c2e-2201`), my session broke after the early reads such that every subsequent `<entity_ref>` and `<request>` parameter was received by the tool runtime as an empty dict, causing every `execute` call to go out with no URL/method/body and return 404 `Not Found`. I could not recover the parameter serialization, so no actual `work_order_id` was ever minted.
